(2376435, 328737, 28710, '<td valign="top">Ahh! She''s blinking! Oyk! I hate it when people blink in my pictures... :)<br/> <br/>It looks like you have some room to grow in a couple of aspects of this picture. In this setting, it might have been difficult to get everything right anyhow....<br/> <br/>Most notably with this picture, I would have sliced off about 30 pixels from the bottom to cut off the front end of the rug...<br/> <br/>Try it and see the effect that it has on the foreground. It removes the figurative barrier of the edge of the carpet and invites the viewer inwards a bit more...</td>', 'Ahh! She''s blinking! Oyk! I hate it when people blink in my pictures... :) It looks like you have some room to grow in a couple of aspects of this picture. In this setting, it might have been difficult to get everything right anyhow.... Most notably with this picture, I would have sliced off about 30 pixels from the bottom to cut off the front end of the rug... Try it and see the effect that it has on the foreground. It removes the figurative barrier of the edge of the carpet and invites the viewer inwards a bit more...', '2006-05-03 10:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
