(2376526, 328635, 28710, '<td valign="top">SWEET!<br/> <br/>Nice use of a centered comp, balancing it with leading lines to the third.<br/> <br/>I don''t know what you did to get the BG like this (maybe a graduated ND filter flipped the other way?), but it looks fantastic!<br/> <br/>Of course, I''m a sucker for bikes and long lonely rides through the mist... (just had a 3 hour bike ride this evening that pretty much fit that description...)<br/> <br/>Just for fun, I''m going to give this a 10. I like it!</td>', 'SWEET! Nice use of a centered comp, balancing it with leading lines to the third. I don''t know what you did to get the BG like this (maybe a graduated ND filter flipped the other way?), but it looks fantastic! Of course, I''m a sucker for bikes and long lonely rides through the mist... (just had a 3 hour bike ride this evening that pretty much fit that description...) Just for fun, I''m going to give this a 10. I like it!', '2006-05-03 10:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
