(2376576, 328790, 28710, '<td valign="top">Dandelions?<br/> <br/>There are some parts of this picture I like, but I get a bit of a disconnected feeling with regards to the title. There doesn''t appear to be any connection to the actual meaning of the saying, regardless of what kind of flower they are.</td>', 'Dandelions? There are some parts of this picture I like, but I get a bit of a disconnected feeling with regards to the title. There doesn''t appear to be any connection to the actual meaning of the saying, regardless of what kind of flower they are.', '2006-05-03 11:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2376595, 328945, 28710, '<td valign="top">I like the Black and white BG idea, but don''t forget to bring the subject AWAY from the background. All those wrinkles would pretty much disappear in the white sheet if you moved the subject forward another 6 inches or more.<br/> <br/>Also, if you deliberately light the BG, it will help get rid of shadows from wrinkles. Same if you put the light behind the sheet.<br/> <br/>Not to worry, I made a similar BG lighting mistake on my submission and needed to work hard to correct for it after the shot was taken. :)</td>', 'I like the Black and white BG idea, but don''t forget to bring the subject AWAY from the background. All those wrinkles would pretty much disappear in the white sheet if you moved the subject forward another 6 inches or more. Also, if you deliberately light the BG, it will help get rid of shadows from wrinkles. Same if you put the light behind the sheet. Not to worry, I made a similar BG lighting mistake on my submission and needed to work hard to correct for it after the shot was taken. :)', '2006-05-03 11:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2376625, 327053, 28710, '<td valign="top">Silly non-American that I am, I''ve never heard of this saying.<br/> <br/>I like this picture though.</td>', 'Silly non-American that I am, I''ve never heard of this saying. I like this picture though.', '2006-05-03 11:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2376632, 328884, 28710, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty clear portrait, but I''m having trouble with linking it to the meaning of the saying *doing something* until you are blue in the face... The portrait is too restive for me to link with this saying. The face is not nearly blue enough either.</td>', 'It''s a pretty clear portrait, but I''m having trouble with linking it to the meaning of the saying *doing something* until you are blue in the face... The portrait is too restive for me to link with this saying. The face is not nearly blue enough either.', '2006-05-03 11:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
