(2376704, 328143, 28710, '<td valign="top">As a guy who has been known to cut a rug here and there and has his own set of vintage 1950''s saddle shoes, I''m digging the style here, but photographically, it''s got some issues.<br/> <br/>Direct flash caused strong shadowing. The BG is somewhat dismal (big white sheets are usually preferred over security signs and birdhouses). The WB is wrong, causing a blue cast (which has done some really bad things to happen throughout the picture, but especially in the flesh tones.... this might also have been the fault of auto levels? I find that it doesn''t like skin tones much) and it appears oversharpened, particularly in the grass and the pinstripes in our hep cat''s zoot.<br/> <br/>It seems swing is still hanging on.<br/> <br/>Keep swingin'' and keep shootin''!</td>', 'As a guy who has been known to cut a rug here and there and has his own set of vintage 1950''s saddle shoes, I''m digging the style here, but photographically, it''s got some issues. Direct flash caused strong shadowing. The BG is somewhat dismal (big white sheets are usually preferred over security signs and birdhouses). The WB is wrong, causing a blue cast (which has done some really bad things to happen throughout the picture, but especially in the flesh tones.... this might also have been the fault of auto levels? I find that it doesn''t like skin tones much) and it appears oversharpened, particularly in the grass and the pinstripes in our hep cat''s zoot. It seems swing is still hanging on. Keep swingin'' and keep shootin''!', '2006-05-03 11:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
