(2377129, 326915, 28710, '<td valign="top">Double your money, double your fun.<br/> <br/>I like how there appears to be a couple of applications of the title in this pic. Indeed, you are blessed to get two such relaxed insects so close together, and blessed will be the cricket when it''s his (her?) turn...<br/> <br/>The only think I don''t like is all the distracting background poking through. A closer crop might have helped that as well as brought more detail to our little friends. I might have done a 35-50 degree clockwise rotation as well to make the rectangle fit the petals better as well as re-align the insects in frame... That''s just my take on it though.</td>', 'Double your money, double your fun. I like how there appears to be a couple of applications of the title in this pic. Indeed, you are blessed to get two such relaxed insects so close together, and blessed will be the cricket when it''s his (her?) turn... The only think I don''t like is all the distracting background poking through. A closer crop might have helped that as well as brought more detail to our little friends. I might have done a 35-50 degree clockwise rotation as well to make the rectangle fit the petals better as well as re-align the insects in frame... That''s just my take on it though.', '2006-05-03 12:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377131, 328480, 34041, '<td valign="top">colours look a bit muted on my monitor.  Perhaps a touch more contrast might help as well.  Overall OK - 6</td>', 'colours look a bit muted on my monitor.  Perhaps a touch more contrast might help as well.  Overall OK - 6', '2006-05-03 12:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
