(2377144, 329228, 28710, '<td valign="top">Ahhh... the dreaded 50/50 split in ''landscape'' pictures...<br/> <br/>It''s nice in a way, but in another way, most of that sky is completely unimportant. More foreground=better.<br/> <br/>Also, it seems that there is no real subject in the picture. What is showing us that there has been a storm recently?</td>', 'Ahhh... the dreaded 50/50 split in ''landscape'' pictures... It''s nice in a way, but in another way, most of that sky is completely unimportant. More foreground=better. Also, it seems that there is no real subject in the picture. What is showing us that there has been a storm recently?', '2006-05-03 12:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
