(2377280, 329266, 34041, '<td valign="top">Wow - could have fit in the members photojournalism challenge - very topical (in Canada, at least).  Nice crop, too.  If I would suggest one thing, I might have flipped this horizonally, so that the flag flowed out to the right, instead of to the left (not sure this would be legal in basic). Since my eyes typically flow left to right, this change would make the image easier to follow, for me anyway.</td>', 'Wow - could have fit in the members photojournalism challenge - very topical (in Canada, at least).  Nice crop, too.  If I would suggest one thing, I might have flipped this horizonally, so that the flag flowed out to the right, instead of to the left (not sure this would be legal in basic). Since my eyes typically flow left to right, this change would make the image easier to follow, for me anyway.', '2006-05-03 13:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
