(2377664, 328438, 19780, '<td valign="top">Good capture of a plane in flight. The composition is a little wonky because of the shift to demonstrate the saying, but it illustrates it well with the tree line being so high.</td>', 'Good capture of a plane in flight. The composition is a little wonky because of the shift to demonstrate the saying, but it illustrates it well with the tree line being so high.', '2006-05-03 14:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
