(2377703, 326958, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wow, very cool! The horizon seems just a little off - I don''t mind a tilted horizon, but either more angle or level might be more pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Wow, very cool! The horizon seems just a little off - I don''t mind a tilted horizon, but either more angle or level might be more pleasing to the eye.', '2006-05-03 14:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
