(2377769, 328737, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of the shot, but the composition is a little off (I know it''s hard with dancing subjects). The dancer''s hand obstructing the drummer is rather distracting as is the rafters of the roofline. <br/> <br/>Could be sharper focus or maybe some more creative cropping and post-processing to work with isolating some portions of the frame.</td>', 'I like the colors of the shot, but the composition is a little off (I know it''s hard with dancing subjects). The dancer''s hand obstructing the drummer is rather distracting as is the rafters of the roofline.  Could be sharper focus or maybe some more creative cropping and post-processing to work with isolating some portions of the frame.', '2006-05-03 14:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
