(2377782, 329173, 19780, '<td valign="top">What fun! I wish there were fewer dog butts (sorry) in the shot and we got to see more of their faces. But I really like the two dogs in the surf - the illustration of so many dogs enjoying themselves in different ways really makes the photo. 7</td>', 'What fun! I wish there were fewer dog butts (sorry) in the shot and we got to see more of their faces. But I really like the two dogs in the surf - the illustration of so many dogs enjoying themselves in different ways really makes the photo. 7', '2006-05-03 14:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377786, 328819, 19780, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - I love the colors, DOF and the model fits this very well. The highlight on the side of the nose is a little distracting, but I love the freckles and how the browline leads the viewer''s eye from the top right to the center left down the nose. 8</td>', 'Beautiful shot - I love the colors, DOF and the model fits this very well. The highlight on the side of the nose is a little distracting, but I love the freckles and how the browline leads the viewer''s eye from the top right to the center left down the nose. 8', '2006-05-03 14:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377789, 328897, 16241, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2006-05-03 14:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377794, 328348, 19780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the DOF. The grain of the shot and B&amp;W gives it a timeless quality and the lighting on the eyes is really great. The composition is just a little off, perhaps because of the blown out highlight on the forearm on the lower right, maybe more of the arm/elbow would have helped.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the DOF. The grain of the shot and B&W gives it a timeless quality and the lighting on the eyes is really great. The composition is just a little off, perhaps because of the blown out highlight on the forearm on the lower right, maybe more of the arm/elbow would have helped.', '2006-05-03 15:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377797, 329131, 35947, '<td valign="top">So creative!!!!  9</td>', 'So creative!!!!  9', '2006-05-03 15:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
