(2377960, 328189, 75713, '<td valign="top">ewwwwwwwwww I hate vultures and I am thinking that is what this is... no hair on their head so they can rummage around inside of dead things.. having said that , thisis a fantastic photo - great bg, well lit - crisp focussed... just creeps me out  :)</td>', 'ewwwwwwwwww I hate vultures and I am thinking that is what this is... no hair on their head so they can rummage around inside of dead things.. having said that , thisis a fantastic photo - great bg, well lit - crisp focussed... just creeps me out  :)', '2006-05-03 15:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377966, 328457, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition of a very beautiful subject.  Like the nice cottony water from the long exposure.  The seems a bit off with the greens, don''t know if it''s exposure or a green I''m not use to seeing in my parts.</td>', 'Very nice composition of a very beautiful subject.  Like the nice cottony water from the long exposure.  The seems a bit off with the greens, don''t know if it''s exposure or a green I''m not use to seeing in my parts.', '2006-05-03 15:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
