(2377973, 329186, 75713, '<td valign="top">I love cats and see that this little guy isn''t all that old - A few things I would like to suggest are - s/he would show up better on a less busy background.  The crop you picked is an interesting; if his/her little foot was moved a bit away from the nose, it might make the composition a little stronger.</td>', 'I love cats and see that this little guy isn''t all that old - A few things I would like to suggest are - s/he would show up better on a less busy background.  The crop you picked is an interesting; if his/her little foot was moved a bit away from the nose, it might make the composition a little stronger.', '2006-05-03 15:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377974, 328029, 19780, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely shot but doesn''t really have anything special that evokes the saying that it''s supposed to illustrate. <br/> <br/>Composition-wise, the earring or whatever it is on the left side of her head is a little distracting. I really like the colors and exposure, the softness of it and the highlight of her hair. 7</td>', 'It''s a lovely shot but doesn''t really have anything special that evokes the saying that it''s supposed to illustrate.  Composition-wise, the earring or whatever it is on the left side of her head is a little distracting. I really like the colors and exposure, the softness of it and the highlight of her hair. 7', '2006-05-03 15:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377979, 329412, 19780, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot! The position of the legs really carries the relationship to the image. The colors are wonderfully vibrant and even though there''s a lot of blue, it''s all wonderfully distinguished.</td>', 'What a fun shot! The position of the legs really carries the relationship to the image. The colors are wonderfully vibrant and even though there''s a lot of blue, it''s all wonderfully distinguished.', '2006-05-03 15:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
