(2377986, 326705, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is too small to see.</td>', 'This is too small to see.', '2006-05-03 15:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377990, 328875, 19780, '<td valign="top">Besides the camo top, I''m not really get the idea of army or what she might be fighting against/for ... there''s just no context (maybe if it was fashioned more like a recruitment poster). Maybe she needs a hat. <br/> <br/>The photo is wonderfully shot, the tones and colors are great.</td>', 'Besides the camo top, I''m not really get the idea of army or what she might be fighting against/for ... there''s just no context (maybe if it was fashioned more like a recruitment poster). Maybe she needs a hat.  The photo is wonderfully shot, the tones and colors are great.', '2006-05-03 15:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377996, 329325, 42100, '<td valign="top">Haven''t heard that cliche before, good photograph with a nice composition.</td>', 'Haven''t heard that cliche before, good photograph with a nice composition.', '2006-05-03 16:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377997, 329400, 34041, '<td valign="top">great colors. My only critique is that you probably missed the perfect composition by about 2 - 3 seconds, where the boat was about 10 feet further away from the dark left edga.  Otherwise a great shot. An 8 from me.</td>', 'great colors. My only critique is that you probably missed the perfect composition by about 2 - 3 seconds, where the boat was about 10 feet further away from the dark left edga.  Otherwise a great shot. An 8 from me.', '2006-05-03 16:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2378001, 329045, 19780, '<td valign="top">A really inventive take on this challenge. There are a number of sayings that could fit this photo (elevator doesn''t go to the top, a quart shy of a gallon, etc.) but it all works. <br/> <br/>I might have liked one more item to push the incongruity of this woman''s life. The shot is great, I love the moodiness of the lighting, her dress and the DOF. 8</td>', 'A really inventive take on this challenge. There are a number of sayings that could fit this photo (elevator doesn''t go to the top, a quart shy of a gallon, etc.) but it all works.  I might have liked one more item to push the incongruity of this woman''s life. The shot is great, I love the moodiness of the lighting, her dress and the DOF. 8', '2006-05-03 16:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2378002, 329418, 34041, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the duotone here.  And there is something sticking in from the rigth edge (too bad it''s a basic editing challenge).  Otherwise, a good image.  A 7 from me.</td>', 'Not sure I like the duotone here.  And there is something sticking in from the rigth edge (too bad it''s a basic editing challenge).  Otherwise, a good image.  A 7 from me.', '2006-05-03 16:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2378011, 328943, 42100, '<td valign="top">Seems like a pretty good photo, but at this small size it''s really hard to tell.  Unfortunately your final score is going to reflect not using the full 640 pixel max, rather than the quality of your photo.  Too bad the lighting looks rather interesting.</td>', 'Seems like a pretty good photo, but at this small size it''s really hard to tell.  Unfortunately your final score is going to reflect not using the full 640 pixel max, rather than the quality of your photo.  Too bad the lighting looks rather interesting.', '2006-05-03 16:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2378017, 328875, 43565, '<td valign="top">Technically a good shot, but I tend not to like using sex to get votes.</td>', 'Technically a good shot, but I tend not to like using sex to get votes.', '2006-05-03 16:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2378021, 329173, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice take to the challenge. The main probably here is the contrast. It fine on the foreground but with the rocks in the back and the water it just looks flat. Not anything you can fix in basic editing really so I probably would have tried to minimize that problem when composing this (i.e. more beach in the shot or have the dogs closer to the water if possible).</td>', 'Nice take to the challenge. The main probably here is the contrast. It fine on the foreground but with the rocks in the back and the water it just looks flat. Not anything you can fix in basic editing really so I probably would have tried to minimize that problem when composing this (i.e. more beach in the shot or have the dogs closer to the water if possible).', '2006-05-03 16:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2378022, 327781, 34041, '<td valign="top">Fire is very difficult to capture well. I know, I''ve tried many times.  You have a bit of blow-out above the match, which takes away from an otherwise very good image. The only way I''ve found to have this type of shot work is to use another medium power light source, from a complementry angle, which will reduce the impact of the fire on the exposure, and then play with sat and contrast in post-processing. Good Luck. A 6 from me.</td>', 'Fire is very difficult to capture well. I know, I''ve tried many times.  You have a bit of blow-out above the match, which takes away from an otherwise very good image. The only way I''ve found to have this type of shot work is to use another medium power light source, from a complementry angle, which will reduce the impact of the fire on the exposure, and then play with sat and contrast in post-processing. Good Luck. A 6 from me.', '2006-05-03 16:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2378023, 327871, 41337, '<td valign="top">Really nice DOF.</td>', 'Really nice DOF.', '2006-05-03 16:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2378029, 329045, 58350, '<td valign="top">really nice capture..</td>', 'really nice capture..', '2006-05-03 16:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2378030, 328931, 34041, '<td valign="top">great idea for the challenge. Nice job of isolating the content from the black background. Unfortunately, toys typically don''t score too high here at DPC, so you''ll likely drop a point just for that.  Overall, a very good technical photo, though. A 6 from me.</td>', 'great idea for the challenge. Nice job of isolating the content from the black background. Unfortunately, toys typically don''t score too high here at DPC, so you''ll likely drop a point just for that.  Overall, a very good technical photo, though. A 6 from me.', '2006-05-03 16:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
