(2379024, 329390, 56999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful representation. The monochromatic image seems to  speak volumes about the character portrayed. Well done</td>', 'Wonderful representation. The monochromatic image seems to  speak volumes about the character portrayed. Well done', '2006-05-03 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
