(2379469, 329078, 55642, '<td valign="top">The shadow across the face doesn''t work. I suspect the sunlight at this time of day would have also been too harsh for a shot facing into the sun, as well. I would have ditched the sunglasses, since they provide too much of a mirror - the photographer is clearly visible. The background is also distracting and makes it look like a hasty shot without much thought put into it.</td>', 'The shadow across the face doesn''t work. I suspect the sunlight at this time of day would have also been too harsh for a shot facing into the sun, as well. I would have ditched the sunglasses, since they provide too much of a mirror - the photographer is clearly visible. The background is also distracting and makes it look like a hasty shot without much thought put into it.', '2006-05-03 21:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
