(2380354, 327531, 28710, '<td valign="top">Came back to this one, but I think I feel about the same way about the picture... It''s interesting that there is a reflection there, but I don''t really think it adds anything to the picture. The unbalanced nature of the two puddles doesn''t help either. Additionally, the angle of view on the train is somewhat less than best... Lots of nice detail, but I would have preferred a more dramatic angle, and a bit more flair, be it for nostalgia or simply for making the major elements of the picture more clear.</td>', 'Came back to this one, but I think I feel about the same way about the picture... It''s interesting that there is a reflection there, but I don''t really think it adds anything to the picture. The unbalanced nature of the two puddles doesn''t help either. Additionally, the angle of view on the train is somewhat less than best... Lots of nice detail, but I would have preferred a more dramatic angle, and a bit more flair, be it for nostalgia or simply for making the major elements of the picture more clear.', '2006-05-04 00:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2380357, 329309, 56452, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but I think you could do better.  For some reason I don''t care for the light/shadow used.   Perhaps a shot of the entire face of the clock with light more from the side to lengthen the shadow.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but I think you could do better.  For some reason I don''t care for the light/shadow used.   Perhaps a shot of the entire face of the clock with light more from the side to lengthen the shadow.', '2006-05-04 00:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
