(2381471, 329133, 38496, '<td valign="top">the colors don''t look natural enough to me.  Also, the composition might have looked interesting with a the tree a little more off center (ie more space to the right, maybe in landscape instead of portrait?)</td>', 'the colors don''t look natural enough to me.  Also, the composition might have looked interesting with a the tree a little more off center (ie more space to the right, maybe in landscape instead of portrait?)', '2006-05-04 09:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
