(2384056, 327598, 42601, '<td valign="top">Very nice setup and idea, but I think the length of the table affected you photo a little here. It feels as if the mouse and the card in the foreground is a little blown, and the distance between the cat and mouse is a little bit too much. Also wouldve liked to have seen more of the table on either side, or maybe casino chips in the middle to break the monotomy. Still, good effort and idea. 6.</td>', 'Very nice setup and idea, but I think the length of the table affected you photo a little here. It feels as if the mouse and the card in the foreground is a little blown, and the distance between the cat and mouse is a little bit too much. Also wouldve liked to have seen more of the table on either side, or maybe casino chips in the middle to break the monotomy. Still, good effort and idea. 6.', '2006-05-05 02:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384057, 327053, 42601, '<td valign="top">I''m sure someone already pointed out your typo - covor = cover :). I like this angle and mood that you have created. Good shot and good luck with the next chalenge!</td>', 'I''m sure someone already pointed out your typo - covor = cover :). I like this angle and mood that you have created. Good shot and good luck with the next chalenge!', '2006-05-05 02:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
