(2384802, 328846, 57480, '<td valign="top">Color/exposure/contrast: 1.5/2 <i>good contrast. palette not very appealing (red shift)</i> <br/>Focus/sharpness/DOF: 2/2 <i>perfect</i> <br/>Idea/creativity: 1/2 <i>good connection with the title pretty common image</i> <br/>Theme: 2/2 <i>fits</i> <br/>Framing/appeal: 2/2 <i>i like the standalone picture</i> <br/>TOTAL:8.5</td>', 'Color/exposure/contrast: 1.5/2 good contrast. palette not very appealing (red shift) Focus/sharpness/DOF: 2/2 perfect Idea/creativity: 1/2 good connection with the title pretty common image Theme: 2/2 fits Framing/appeal: 2/2 i like the standalone picture TOTAL:8.5', '2006-05-05 10:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
