(2385213, 327942, 19780, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s a picture of a cat and I''m usually loathe to say anything like DNMC, but it doesn''t really illustrate the saying. As a composition, the blown out highlights in the lower right and along the right side don''t help me much. The Focus seems a little soft and undefined.</td>', 'Well, it''s a picture of a cat and I''m usually loathe to say anything like DNMC, but it doesn''t really illustrate the saying. As a composition, the blown out highlights in the lower right and along the right side don''t help me much. The Focus seems a little soft and undefined.', '2006-05-05 14:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385217, 329012, 45524, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, the clarity and sharpness of it are very good. I wish it wasnt so centered though. Dropped off to one side and down to the bottom this photo would be amazing. 6</td>', 'I like this photo, the clarity and sharpness of it are very good. I wish it wasnt so centered though. Dropped off to one side and down to the bottom this photo would be amazing. 6', '2006-05-05 14:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385220, 329195, 45524, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and colored photograph well done. Gets an 8 from me.</td>', 'Nicely composed and colored photograph well done. Gets an 8 from me.', '2006-05-05 14:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385243, 329289, 56454, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  The background is distracting.  Also, I wonder if some more separation between the sheets would have been more dramatic (but maybe impossible to catch).  I like the inclusion of writing on the sheets of paper because it quickly identifies them as sheets of paper.</td>', 'I like the idea.  The background is distracting.  Also, I wonder if some more separation between the sheets would have been more dramatic (but maybe impossible to catch).  I like the inclusion of writing on the sheets of paper because it quickly identifies them as sheets of paper.', '2006-05-05 14:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385253, 327886, 56454, '<td valign="top">That''s one big elephant.  I saw a Discovery Channel show about a similar elephant (in New Jersey?) that had to be moved.  I wondered if it might be the same one.  Anyway, I looked at it on two monitors and it looks a little more orange than pink to me, but I''ll give you benefit of the doubt.  A bigger issue for me is the trees in the background; a little distracting.</td>', 'That''s one big elephant.  I saw a Discovery Channel show about a similar elephant (in New Jersey?) that had to be moved.  I wondered if it might be the same one.  Anyway, I looked at it on two monitors and it looks a little more orange than pink to me, but I''ll give you benefit of the doubt.  A bigger issue for me is the trees in the background; a little distracting.', '2006-05-05 14:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385263, 329257, 56454, '<td valign="top">Gutsy "saying" in our PC world.<br/>I would have prefered the snow to be a little brighter (considering the implied contrast of the saying), but know that snow is hard to keep some texture but keep bright white.  While the swirl of the ridge helps, it is a little too centered IMO.</td>', 'Gutsy "saying" in our PC world.I would have prefered the snow to be a little brighter (considering the implied contrast of the saying), but know that snow is hard to keep some texture but keep bright white.  While the swirl of the ridge helps, it is a little too centered IMO.', '2006-05-05 14:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385266, 329396, 56454, '<td valign="top">I like the positioning of the boat at the top and the use of space at the bottom.  The light and reflection on the right is a little overpowering, IMO.</td>', 'I like the positioning of the boat at the top and the use of space at the bottom.  The light and reflection on the right is a little overpowering, IMO.', '2006-05-05 14:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385273, 328581, 56454, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That''s a lot of color (in a good way).  I like the sense of a "second horizon" created by the rocks it really widens the image.  Too bad you weren''t lucky enough to have a sailboat passing by at just that moment.  ;-)  Nice job.</td>', 'Wow.  That''s a lot of color (in a good way).  I like the sense of a "second horizon" created by the rocks it really widens the image.  Too bad you weren''t lucky enough to have a sailboat passing by at just that moment.  ;-)  Nice job.', '2006-05-05 14:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385283, 328829, 56454, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what that structure is but it sure looks like a boat.  The long grass really looks like water being pushed aside too.  Nice job. There are some unfortunate background elements.  A little more color saturation may have aded too.  Nice image though.</td>', 'I don''t know what that structure is but it sure looks like a boat.  The long grass really looks like water being pushed aside too.  Nice job. There are some unfortunate background elements.  A little more color saturation may have aded too.  Nice image though.', '2006-05-05 14:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385284, 327986, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Along the lines of the chameleon pic. Good color. Great detail. Off centered works great. My top pic. Bumping up.</td>', 'Great shot. Along the lines of the chameleon pic. Good color. Great detail. Off centered works great. My top pic. Bumping up.', '2006-05-05 15:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385286, 328349, 56454, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between color of the child with the grey all around.</td>', 'Nice contrast between color of the child with the grey all around.', '2006-05-05 15:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385287, 328278, 53147, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Great sharpness and clarity on all three subjects. Great capture. Bumpin gup.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Great sharpness and clarity on all three subjects. Great capture. Bumpin gup.', '2006-05-05 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385291, 329189, 53147, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Cropped a little lower would have been nice IMO. Would have given enough space to finsh out the circle of the moon ( I know, you couldnt see it anyways - just a bit of nitpicking on a shot I couldnt find anything else wrong with). Bumping up.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Cropped a little lower would have been nice IMO. Would have given enough space to finsh out the circle of the moon ( I know, you couldnt see it anyways - just a bit of nitpicking on a shot I couldnt find anything else wrong with). Bumping up.', '2006-05-05 15:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385292, 327458, 53147, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Great haze and the radically different plant life on the three islands work really well.</td>', 'Gorgeous. Great haze and the radically different plant life on the three islands work really well.', '2006-05-05 15:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385297, 328747, 53147, '<td valign="top">I guess I am just a sucker for these silhouette bird shots. Great angle. Wish the background color was just a little bit more (more what I dont really know - just more). Great shot. Bumping up.</td>', 'I guess I am just a sucker for these silhouette bird shots. Great angle. Wish the background color was just a little bit more (more what I dont really know - just more). Great shot. Bumping up.', '2006-05-05 15:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
