(2388444, 329426, 29906, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and beautiful model, but lighting can be improved a lot. My guess is that you used a direct flash pointed at the model''s face which what caused the blown highlights on the face and the hard shadows on the right arm. If you would''ve used indirect lights, this would''ve scored much better.. Still a good shot, I give it a 6.</td>', 'Interesting concept and beautiful model, but lighting can be improved a lot. My guess is that you used a direct flash pointed at the model''s face which what caused the blown highlights on the face and the hard shadows on the right arm. If you would''ve used indirect lights, this would''ve scored much better.. Still a good shot, I give it a 6.', '2006-05-06 23:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
