(2389032, 329257, 36808, '<td valign="top">I find the title to be crass, immature and offensive (and I''m skeptical that it''s even real).  Surely you could''ve thought of something that would not be as insensitive to us voters.  There was no need for it, and I''m guessing you did this only to instigate a rant.  That speaks volumes on the photographer and so much less about the photo itself.  How unfortunate.</td>', 'I find the title to be crass, immature and offensive (and I''m skeptical that it''s even real).  Surely you could''ve thought of something that would not be as insensitive to us voters.  There was no need for it, and I''m guessing you did this only to instigate a rant.  That speaks volumes on the photographer and so much less about the photo itself.  How unfortunate.', '2006-05-07 04:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
