(2392807, 329388, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF but the composition, not so much.  Feel like you could have made more of the straws leading me towards the needle.  Nice shot still, gave it a 6.</td>', 'Love the DOF but the composition, not so much.  Feel like you could have made more of the straws leading me towards the needle.  Nice shot still, gave it a 6.', '2006-05-08 10:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392812, 326903, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hehe, that doesn´t work with celebration, everything is marked so well!  :D  Good job on the lighting, hard to light something that reflects light like that.</td>', 'Hehe, that doesn´t work with celebration, everything is marked so well!  :D  Good job on the lighting, hard to light something that reflects light like that.', '2006-05-08 10:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392820, 327070, 27482, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the image quality.  Too noicy, got CA all over the edges and a bit too soft.  If it had been of good image quality this would have rocked, that and maybe something other than a blown out backround, like a nice blue sky or green foliage.</td>', 'Too bad about the image quality.  Too noicy, got CA all over the edges and a bit too soft.  If it had been of good image quality this would have rocked, that and maybe something other than a blown out backround, like a nice blue sky or green foliage.', '2006-05-08 10:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392822, 327586, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, too bad it´s hard to enjoy it in such a small version, why not make the most of the max 640 pixles you are allowed?</td>', 'Lovely photo, too bad it´s hard to enjoy it in such a small version, why not make the most of the max 640 pixles you are allowed?', '2006-05-08 10:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392948, 328581, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, excellent sunset, had a similar one here yesterday, mmmmmm I can just feel summer coming :D</td>', 'Lovely shot, excellent sunset, had a similar one here yesterday, mmmmmm I can just feel summer coming :D', '2006-05-08 11:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392956, 328635, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really fond of the composition, the biker is to centered for my taste and too much "sky", I would have placed him up in the right corner as per the rule of thirds but other than that, great shot, love the tones in it and exposure and the fog really does a lot for this shot.  Got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Not really fond of the composition, the biker is to centered for my taste and too much "sky", I would have placed him up in the right corner as per the rule of thirds but other than that, great shot, love the tones in it and exposure and the fog really does a lot for this shot.  Got a 7 from me.', '2006-05-08 11:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392959, 329237, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the small movement of the hand, gives this shot a small boost.</td>', 'I like the small movement of the hand, gives this shot a small boost.', '2006-05-08 11:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392966, 329330, 27482, '<td valign="top">LOVE the toning in this image, gave it a 9.  Would have given it a 10 if you had ripped off that leaf that is up towards the top and is pointing this way and is out of focus, it´s just too irritatingly out of focus and out of place for my taste.</td>', 'LOVE the toning in this image, gave it a 9.  Would have given it a 10 if you had ripped off that leaf that is up towards the top and is pointing this way and is out of focus, it´s just too irritatingly out of focus and out of place for my taste.', '2006-05-08 11:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392971, 326958, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really crazy about the post processing, gives off a strong halo around the pig that I do not like and I am not surprised this had to be validated, I too would have suggested an inquiry.  Also the saturation is too strong for my taste.<br/> <br/>Having said that though I LOVE the idea and it made me smile and the composition is very good along with the choice of backround.  Still gave this a 6 dispite the poor image quality :)  Keep it up!</td>', 'Not really crazy about the post processing, gives off a strong halo around the pig that I do not like and I am not surprised this had to be validated, I too would have suggested an inquiry.  Also the saturation is too strong for my taste. Having said that though I LOVE the idea and it made me smile and the composition is very good along with the choice of backround.  Still gave this a 6 dispite the poor image quality :)  Keep it up!', '2006-05-08 11:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392973, 329426, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good looking model, bad photo.  I would definately take advantage at knowing a girl like this, drag her out and take some photos of her there if you don´t have studio access, make use of dusk and dawn and above all, dont take pictures of her for challenges with the built in flash.  Just leads to unflattering ugly shadows and harsh lighting.  You can do better :)</td>', 'Good looking model, bad photo.  I would definately take advantage at knowing a girl like this, drag her out and take some photos of her there if you don´t have studio access, make use of dusk and dawn and above all, dont take pictures of her for challenges with the built in flash.  Just leads to unflattering ugly shadows and harsh lighting.  You can do better :)', '2006-05-08 11:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392974, 327881, 27482, '<td valign="top">Yup gotta agree, gave it a 1!!!<br/>.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>Just kidding!  :)  Like the shot and composition and DOF, just think it could use some more contrast, seems a bit flat as it is.</td>', 'Yup gotta agree, gave it a 1!!!.......Just kidding!  :)  Like the shot and composition and DOF, just think it could use some more contrast, seems a bit flat as it is.', '2006-05-08 11:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392981, 328875, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really digging the pose, I don´t feel like it does her justice and makes her butt and stomach seem bigger than they actually are, she seems to have an awesome figure.  Nothing wrong with the lighting, that is top notch.</td>', 'Not really digging the pose, I don´t feel like it does her justice and makes her butt and stomach seem bigger than they actually are, she seems to have an awesome figure.  Nothing wrong with the lighting, that is top notch.', '2006-05-08 11:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392989, 329326, 16402, '<td valign="top">Clever concept and great DOF.</td>', 'Clever concept and great DOF.', '2006-05-08 11:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393003, 328571, 16402, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait with nice lighting and compositon as well as a cute subject.</td>', 'Lovely portrait with nice lighting and compositon as well as a cute subject.', '2006-05-08 11:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393006, 329291, 16402, '<td valign="top">Think this shot would have turned out so much better if it had been shot from the front where we could see their expressions and positoning more. I realize that may not have been an option.</td>', 'Think this shot would have turned out so much better if it had been shot from the front where we could see their expressions and positoning more. I realize that may not have been an option.', '2006-05-08 11:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393013, 329052, 16402, '<td valign="top">Image is too small and there is too little detail in the subject (person) to tell much about them and what they''re doing, sorry.</td>', 'Image is too small and there is too little detail in the subject (person) to tell much about them and what they''re doing, sorry.', '2006-05-08 11:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393021, 327059, 16402, '<td valign="top">Love the composition with him lit brightly against dark sky and her darker against lighter section of sky and water reflection. They both have perfect expressions for the title too. Excellent job.</td>', 'Love the composition with him lit brightly against dark sky and her darker against lighter section of sky and water reflection. They both have perfect expressions for the title too. Excellent job.', '2006-05-08 11:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393027, 328673, 16402, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit harsh and that makes it look a lot like a snapshot but not a bad effort.</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit harsh and that makes it look a lot like a snapshot but not a bad effort.', '2006-05-08 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393043, 329194, 57990, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and like the clenched hand....<br/>Great idea.</td>', 'Great lighting and like the clenched hand....Great idea.', '2006-05-08 11:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393056, 328664, 57990, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Lovely Idea.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Lovely Idea.', '2006-05-08 11:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393059, 329069, 52285, '<td valign="top">Absolutely hilarious.</td>', 'Absolutely hilarious.', '2006-05-08 11:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
