(2393098, 329405, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I think you could have composed this better, the bird and plant it´s sitting in is in the dead center, just isn´t working here for me.  Sorry.</td>', 'Nice, but I think you could have composed this better, the bird and plant it´s sitting in is in the dead center, just isn´t working here for me.  Sorry.', '2006-05-08 12:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393132, 329131, 57722, '<td valign="top">I like it</td>', 'I like it', '2006-05-08 12:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393151, 327237, 739, '<td valign="top">would have been better if you have several baskets with eggs in each.</td>', 'would have been better if you have several baskets with eggs in each.', '2006-05-08 12:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393189, 328393, 739, '<td valign="top">cropped just a bit too tight.</td>', 'cropped just a bit too tight.', '2006-05-08 12:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393328, 326896, 56454, '<td valign="top">Fantastic bolor and lighting. I looked at it several times before noticing that whatever it is they are on looks to be a "birdman".</td>', 'Fantastic bolor and lighting. I looked at it several times before noticing that whatever it is they are on looks to be a "birdman".', '2006-05-08 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393333, 329163, 56454, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and texture. Nice use of DOF too.</td>', 'Wonderful color and texture. Nice use of DOF too.', '2006-05-08 13:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393338, 328601, 56454, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  Color, lighting, composition, DOF, and a great expression.</td>', 'Nice job.  Color, lighting, composition, DOF, and a great expression.', '2006-05-08 13:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393356, 329046, 56454, '<td valign="top">Nice up close and personal shot.  I looks like it was rotated in post (observation not criticism).  I like the deep green in the background (although it has some noise).  The curve of the nose keeps bringing attention back to the eye.  Nice job.</td>', 'Nice up close and personal shot.  I looks like it was rotated in post (observation not criticism).  I like the deep green in the background (although it has some noise).  The curve of the nose keeps bringing attention back to the eye.  Nice job.', '2006-05-08 13:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393362, 328843, 56454, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the "money shots".  It looks like there is a lot of post-production processing but I think it works well in your image.</td>', 'My favorite of the "money shots".  It looks like there is a lot of post-production processing but I think it works well in your image.', '2006-05-08 13:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393384, 329348, 56454, '<td valign="top">I really like the boy''s position (looking at his shadow but still walking) and the lighting is very good.  I would have preferred to see the entire shadow but see how that could be hard to do.</td>', 'I really like the boy''s position (looking at his shadow but still walking) and the lighting is very good.  I would have preferred to see the entire shadow but see how that could be hard to do.', '2006-05-08 13:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393417, 328864, 56454, '<td valign="top">I''ve had a hard time rating this one.  Part of me really likes it and part is unsure.  I can''t identify what makes me unsure.  Maybe something about the flowers.  I like the girl''s expression and the contrast of light and dark (top and bottom).  Anyway, I''m going to bump it up to a higher score and leave it there.</td>', 'I''ve had a hard time rating this one.  Part of me really likes it and part is unsure.  I can''t identify what makes me unsure.  Maybe something about the flowers.  I like the girl''s expression and the contrast of light and dark (top and bottom).  Anyway, I''m going to bump it up to a higher score and leave it there.', '2006-05-08 13:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393443, 328965, 56454, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and expression.  IMO, the cat detracts from the shot.  It would be more powerful without it.</td>', 'Nice lighting and expression.  IMO, the cat detracts from the shot.  It would be more powerful without it.', '2006-05-08 13:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393470, 327988, 56454, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing a moment.  IMO, more directional light (or maybe more accurately less uniform light) would make it a more "intimate" shot.</td>', 'Nice job capturing a moment.  IMO, more directional light (or maybe more accurately less uniform light) would make it a more "intimate" shot.', '2006-05-08 13:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393489, 326705, 40921, '<td valign="top">Too small, hard to see the detail. Very creative idea however.</td>', 'Too small, hard to see the detail. Very creative idea however.', '2006-05-08 13:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393497, 329352, 40921, '<td valign="top">The live duck seems a little blurry, and the toy duck on the right seems over exposed.</td>', 'The live duck seems a little blurry, and the toy duck on the right seems over exposed.', '2006-05-08 13:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393501, 327179, 56454, '<td valign="top">IMO, this is almost a great shot.  For me, the thick "borders" don''t help.  I think I see what you were going for but I don''t think it quite gets there.</td>', 'IMO, this is almost a great shot.  For me, the thick "borders" don''t help.  I think I see what you were going for but I don''t think it quite gets there.', '2006-05-08 13:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393518, 329024, 56454, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I like his expression.  I wonder if a dark and uniform background would make it more dramatic.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I like his expression.  I wonder if a dark and uniform background would make it more dramatic.', '2006-05-08 14:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
