(2394114, 327995, 332, '<td valign="top">Maby a bit out of focus or the camera moved a little bit when you took the picture. The names are a bit blurry. You could try to use a tripod when shooting in bad lighting. And set the shooter to release after 2 or 10 second. If you do that you minimize the shaking of the camera. :)</td>', 'Maby a bit out of focus or the camera moved a little bit when you took the picture. The names are a bit blurry. You could try to use a tripod when shooting in bad lighting. And set the shooter to release after 2 or 10 second. If you do that you minimize the shaking of the camera. :)', '2006-05-08 16:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
