(2394661, 328606, 332, '<td valign="top">Letters on a silvery thing... People will probably rate this in the lower part of the challange. The saying is great and I think you could have done better with that idea. Someone walking and balancing somewhere. Good luck in future challanges.</td>', 'Letters on a silvery thing... People will probably rate this in the lower part of the challange. The saying is great and I think you could have done better with that idea. Someone walking and balancing somewhere. Good luck in future challanges.', '2006-05-08 19:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394663, 328457, 19780, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, beautiful rich colors and the exposure is wonderful. 8</td>', 'Lovely shot, beautiful rich colors and the exposure is wonderful. 8', '2006-05-08 19:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394666, 328278, 19780, '<td valign="top">Really great capture. The intense focus of both subjects on the ball and the attention of the spectators really makes this shine. The repetition of the red/orange in the seats and the jersey makes the whole thing pop. Bumping this up from an 8 to a 9.</td>', 'Really great capture. The intense focus of both subjects on the ball and the attention of the spectators really makes this shine. The repetition of the red/orange in the seats and the jersey makes the whole thing pop. Bumping this up from an 8 to a 9.', '2006-05-08 19:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394670, 328216, 19780, '<td valign="top">A nice idea and a good composition but not quite well executed. The little band of black up in the corner is distracting. I like the reflection on the knife. <br/> <br/>Of course it could be in sharper focus. 4</td>', 'A nice idea and a good composition but not quite well executed. The little band of black up in the corner is distracting. I like the reflection on the knife.  Of course it could be in sharper focus. 4', '2006-05-08 19:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394672, 327939, 19780, '<td valign="top">The tilt of the frame doesn''t help the composition here. I like the grainy quality and the monochrome, but that little strip of white in the lower right and the space above her head kind of distracts from the focus on the subject. 4</td>', 'The tilt of the frame doesn''t help the composition here. I like the grainy quality and the monochrome, but that little strip of white in the lower right and the space above her head kind of distracts from the focus on the subject. 4', '2006-05-08 19:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394673, 329426, 19780, '<td valign="top">It''s not quite in focus enough for me, and the harsh shadows have blown out the  highlights.</td>', 'It''s not quite in focus enough for me, and the harsh shadows have blown out the  highlights.', '2006-05-08 19:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394676, 328520, 19780, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting saying, but the waterfall doesn''t really illustrate it for me. That said, it''s a very interesting shot the way you''ve shifted the colors to give it that eerie, otherworldly quality.</td>', 'It''s an interesting saying, but the waterfall doesn''t really illustrate it for me. That said, it''s a very interesting shot the way you''ve shifted the colors to give it that eerie, otherworldly quality.', '2006-05-08 19:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394678, 328323, 19780, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed to show the path of the boat. The speed is evident and the colors pop nicely. It could use just a little more contrast (IMO).</td>', 'Nicely framed to show the path of the boat. The speed is evident and the colors pop nicely. It could use just a little more contrast (IMO).', '2006-05-08 19:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394686, 328727, 19780, '<td valign="top">The grains of the wood look rather like stormy waves of the sea. The contrast is a little dim and the shot could benefit from better framing of some more compelling part of the wood or perhaps a more interesting angle. 4</td>', 'The grains of the wood look rather like stormy waves of the sea. The contrast is a little dim and the shot could benefit from better framing of some more compelling part of the wood or perhaps a more interesting angle. 4', '2006-05-08 19:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394695, 327005, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the saying! I like the colors and balance and even the angle. However, I''m not really keen on the little dusty bits in the frame and the slightly tipped horizon. If it were angled a bit more, I''d be okay, but it''s in that range that just looks a little off. 5</td>', 'Very interesting take on the saying! I like the colors and balance and even the angle. However, I''m not really keen on the little dusty bits in the frame and the slightly tipped horizon. If it were angled a bit more, I''d be okay, but it''s in that range that just looks a little off. 5', '2006-05-08 19:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394698, 328961, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the subject of the dog and the expression, but the size of the photo is a little small for making out the detail. I''m missing the eyes, especially, which could have really sold this saying.</td>', 'I like the subject of the dog and the expression, but the size of the photo is a little small for making out the detail. I''m missing the eyes, especially, which could have really sold this saying.', '2006-05-08 19:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394701, 329011, 19780, '<td valign="top">An interesting way of looking at the phrase. The subject isn''t completely centered and could have been a bit bigger (if you wanted to).</td>', 'An interesting way of looking at the phrase. The subject isn''t completely centered and could have been a bit bigger (if you wanted to).', '2006-05-08 19:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394703, 328943, 19780, '<td valign="top">I kind of like the moody lighting and soft focus, but it would have helped if the pic was a little bigger. I can''t tell what''s in the bottom/foreground there.</td>', 'I kind of like the moody lighting and soft focus, but it would have helped if the pic was a little bigger. I can''t tell what''s in the bottom/foreground there.', '2006-05-08 19:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394708, 329091, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail on the pattern of the snake''s skin. I like the monochromatic nature of the photo with the wall the same color family as the snake''s skin. The darkness of the lower left doesn''t help the composition though.</td>', 'Very nice detail on the pattern of the snake''s skin. I like the monochromatic nature of the photo with the wall the same color family as the snake''s skin. The darkness of the lower left doesn''t help the composition though.', '2006-05-08 19:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394712, 329052, 19780, '<td valign="top">I really wish this was bigger because I like what I''m able to see at this size.</td>', 'I really wish this was bigger because I like what I''m able to see at this size.', '2006-05-08 19:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394715, 327969, 19780, '<td valign="top">A nice picture of a cat, but I''m not getting the sense that he''s away from his quarry or what the mice are up to. That said, it''s a good photo, I like the off-center composition and the light in his eyes and the depth of field.</td>', 'A nice picture of a cat, but I''m not getting the sense that he''s away from his quarry or what the mice are up to. That said, it''s a good photo, I like the off-center composition and the light in his eyes and the depth of field.', '2006-05-08 19:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394716, 328608, 19780, '<td valign="top">A good representation - but the shot is a little drab. A little closer attention to the composition to make it a compelling shot outside of the challenge title would help. The exposure on the cat face lacks detail and the colors/contract lack definition.</td>', 'A good representation - but the shot is a little drab. A little closer attention to the composition to make it a compelling shot outside of the challenge title would help. The exposure on the cat face lacks detail and the colors/contract lack definition.', '2006-05-08 19:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394721, 328606, 19780, '<td valign="top">An interesting capture. I do like the find, how they haven''t painted with care and that the sign is faded, perhaps with neglect. I''m not sure how I feel about the cropping, I might have liked more context to place the sign.</td>', 'An interesting capture. I do like the find, how they haven''t painted with care and that the sign is faded, perhaps with neglect. I''m not sure how I feel about the cropping, I might have liked more context to place the sign.', '2006-05-08 20:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395125, 328052, 58571, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! What an opportunity!</td>', 'Awesome shot! What an opportunity!', '2006-05-08 22:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395200, 329388, 43088, '<td valign="top">Took a couple of moments to find the needle!</td>', 'Took a couple of moments to find the needle!', '2006-05-08 23:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395233, 329318, 43088, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh!</td>', 'Made me laugh!', '2006-05-08 23:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395281, 329387, 49198, '<td valign="top">Just needs a bit more focus ...</td>', 'Just needs a bit more focus ...', '2006-05-08 23:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395342, 329142, 45524, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, meets the challenge well, saturation is pretty good on the landscape, however its a bit over saturated on the skin. I''d recommend backing down the reds a bit using selective color. Otherwise nicely done.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, meets the challenge well, saturation is pretty good on the landscape, however its a bit over saturated on the skin. I''d recommend backing down the reds a bit using selective color. Otherwise nicely done.', '2006-05-09 00:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395351, 328958, 45524, '<td valign="top">This is s nicely done photograph. Nice Horizon, nice use of long exposure to handle the smooth flow of water. Its nicely saturated and yet not blowen out. Near perfect exposure I''d say. This is an 8 from me. Well done.</td>', 'This is s nicely done photograph. Nice Horizon, nice use of long exposure to handle the smooth flow of water. Its nicely saturated and yet not blowen out. Near perfect exposure I''d say. This is an 8 from me. Well done.', '2006-05-09 00:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395361, 329403, 45524, '<td valign="top">This is a nice setup, and idea. I''d like to offer some help on getting the photo a better rated score. I''d suggest trying to using levels and curves to take the white up to have a cleaner background area. I''d also suggest that its just a bit under exposed on the apple. Perhaps an exposure adjustment as well. maybe a little more forward light. Also adding more light on the background without getting it on the subject will help.</td>', 'This is a nice setup, and idea. I''d like to offer some help on getting the photo a better rated score. I''d suggest trying to using levels and curves to take the white up to have a cleaner background area. I''d also suggest that its just a bit under exposed on the apple. Perhaps an exposure adjustment as well. maybe a little more forward light. Also adding more light on the background without getting it on the subject will help.', '2006-05-09 00:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395370, 329179, 45524, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea and well setup, I like the idea very much, however for me I wish you had used a larger DOF so that the person would be in focus as well. The focus on the speaker is awesome, just wish it extended out a bit.</td>', 'This is a nice idea and well setup, I like the idea very much, however for me I wish you had used a larger DOF so that the person would be in focus as well. The focus on the speaker is awesome, just wish it extended out a bit.', '2006-05-09 00:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395374, 328829, 45524, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, the angle seems a bit too low, I''d like to get a better view of what your subject it, I think its a boat, but I''d like to know for sure. I''d also bump the saturation and contrast just a touch to give it some pop. Meets the challenge well.</td>', 'I like this idea, the angle seems a bit too low, I''d like to get a better view of what your subject it, I think its a boat, but I''d like to know for sure. I''d also bump the saturation and contrast just a touch to give it some pop. Meets the challenge well.', '2006-05-09 00:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395381, 329189, 45524, '<td valign="top">I love moon shots. I''m envious that you have such a well done shot. I like the color cast of the blue. I wish the crop was a bit different though. Maybe put the moon up a touch and to the right. Overall a good entry that meets the challenge well. 6 or 7 from me cant decide right now.</td>', 'I love moon shots. I''m envious that you have such a well done shot. I like the color cast of the blue. I wish the crop was a bit different though. Maybe put the moon up a touch and to the right. Overall a good entry that meets the challenge well. 6 or 7 from me cant decide right now.', '2006-05-09 00:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395391, 327519, 45524, '<td valign="top">NIce use of DOF, not sure I really like the pano look. But it fits the challenge well and is a nicely done shot. Maybe bump the saturation a touch and maybe the contrast. I''d also like to see a little more sharpness with it. Overall well done. Its a 6 from me.</td>', 'NIce use of DOF, not sure I really like the pano look. But it fits the challenge well and is a nicely done shot. Maybe bump the saturation a touch and maybe the contrast. I''d also like to see a little more sharpness with it. Overall well done. Its a 6 from me.', '2006-05-09 00:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395393, 328934, 45524, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of this, and the sharpness as well. I usually dont like the border use on this, but in this instance the border seems to compliment it well. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the colors of this, and the sharpness as well. I usually dont like the border use on this, but in this instance the border seems to compliment it well. Nicely done.', '2006-05-09 00:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2395400, 328831, 45524, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF, but I''d really like to see the roses that the subject is smelling. Leaves me wondering just what color they are.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF, but I''d really like to see the roses that the subject is smelling. Leaves me wondering just what color they are.', '2006-05-09 00:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
