(2396765, 327519, 16402, '<td valign="top">Sorry but never heard that one before. I do like the way the stone matches the birds so well and all of those contrast with the green grass.</td>', 'Sorry but never heard that one before. I do like the way the stone matches the birds so well and all of those contrast with the green grass.', '2006-05-09 11:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396768, 329045, 47534, '<td valign="top">great use of lighting/contrast... very good picture!!!</td>', 'great use of lighting/contrast... very good picture!!!', '2006-05-09 11:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396771, 328897, 16402, '<td valign="top">You''re killing me! Good job. I especially like how you matched the bow color to the harness.</td>', 'You''re killing me! Good job. I especially like how you matched the bow color to the harness.', '2006-05-09 11:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396774, 327282, 47534, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but shouldn''t they be birds?</td>', 'nice picture, but shouldn''t they be birds?', '2006-05-09 11:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396780, 329289, 16402, '<td valign="top">Great execution of the idea. Maybe just a bit more motion blur would have made it pop more.</td>', 'Great execution of the idea. Maybe just a bit more motion blur would have made it pop more.', '2006-05-09 11:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396782, 328073, 47534, '<td valign="top">Terrific!!! Oh, and thanks for bringing back wonderful memories of years spent in Spain!</td>', 'Terrific!!! Oh, and thanks for bringing back wonderful memories of years spent in Spain!', '2006-05-09 11:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396783, 327844, 45004, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a hook in the image. The bobbers in the background are what told me what the image was, not the forground that is in focus.</td>', 'I would have liked to see a hook in the image. The bobbers in the background are what told me what the image was, not the forground that is in focus.', '2006-05-09 11:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396784, 327993, 16402, '<td valign="top">For a floral I really like this. Great composition, rythem and DOF.</td>', 'For a floral I really like this. Great composition, rythem and DOF.', '2006-05-09 11:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396785, 329405, 47534, '<td valign="top">where is it?  (the worm...)</td>', 'where is it?  (the worm...)', '2006-05-09 11:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396788, 329322, 47534, '<td valign="top">love how playful this is!!!!</td>', 'love how playful this is!!!!', '2006-05-09 11:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396790, 328875, 47534, '<td valign="top">YES MA''AM!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'YES MA''AM!!!!!!!!!', '2006-05-09 11:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396793, 328951, 16402, '<td valign="top">I like this but the lighting is very hard. I think I''d have tried to soften the shadows a bit with some fill flash or a reflector of some sort. Also, her positioning seems funny, think it might have looked better if her back had been against the wall (hey, another cliche) and she was pushing on the rock. Just a few thoughts, hope they help.</td>', 'I like this but the lighting is very hard. I think I''d have tried to soften the shadows a bit with some fill flash or a reflector of some sort. Also, her positioning seems funny, think it might have looked better if her back had been against the wall (hey, another cliche) and she was pushing on the rock. Just a few thoughts, hope they help.', '2006-05-09 11:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396794, 328825, 47534, '<td valign="top">are they doing what i think they are???  kewl!</td>', 'are they doing what i think they are???  kewl!', '2006-05-09 11:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
