(2397639, 328608, 35602, '<td valign="top">Cute kitty.  If you have a white balance adjustment on your camera, you might want to take a reading before shooting.  Also, if you did not use a tripod, the use of one allows you to take a longer exposure without camera shake which would get a nice clear image.</td>', 'Cute kitty.  If you have a white balance adjustment on your camera, you might want to take a reading before shooting.  Also, if you did not use a tripod, the use of one allows you to take a longer exposure without camera shake which would get a nice clear image.', '2006-05-09 16:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
