(2398221, 329179, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good balance. I Like the shadows and it´s rare case when a single light source works well. It seems to have a smoke that add a lot to the tension sugested. If this fog/smoke can be made more visible , will be far greather.</td>', 'Good balance. I Like the shadows and it´s rare case when a single light source works well. It seems to have a smoke that add a lot to the tension sugested. If this fog/smoke can be made more visible , will be far greather.', '2006-05-09 20:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2398234, 329153, 13759, '<td valign="top">Really good light. Soft and powerfull. I guess a softbox or high difused foto flood? I hope to find more comments on this light source and set up after the challenge end.<br/>The theme itself needs a bit of imagination, but is very interesting picture.</td>', 'Really good light. Soft and powerfull. I guess a softbox or high difused foto flood? I hope to find more comments on this light source and set up after the challenge end.The theme itself needs a bit of imagination, but is very interesting picture.', '2006-05-09 20:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2398240, 327001, 51570, '<td valign="top">so cute!!!!!!!</td>', 'so cute!!!!!!!', '2006-05-09 20:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2398241, 329074, 13759, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. A simple improvements can made it a great picture.<br/>1) Light, is dull and very harsh (it makes very defined light shadows definitions) and it hurts the message of pictures.<br/>2) Scenary sugest a street case, then preserve it but adds to your composition capturing less wires, poles and commom elements. A simple crop tight can solve in many situations.<br/>3) Movement. This scene has a lot of movement. I can saw that hand in low shutter speed.</td>', 'Nice idea. A simple improvements can made it a great picture.1) Light, is dull and very harsh (it makes very defined light shadows definitions) and it hurts the message of pictures.2) Scenary sugest a street case, then preserve it but adds to your composition capturing less wires, poles and commom elements. A simple crop tight can solve in many situations.3) Movement. This scene has a lot of movement. I can saw that hand in low shutter speed.', '2006-05-09 20:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
