(2408308, 327994, 38496, '<td valign="top">Creative idea!  I like the colors and the composition.  Except that part of my mind is waiting for gravity to take over, and for the candies to come tumbling down.  The focus could be a little sharper at the top of the photo.  I''m not sure I love the border, although I see the point in adding it, since there is so much white in the composition.<br/>over all a very creative and nicely done entry.</td>', 'Creative idea!  I like the colors and the composition.  Except that part of my mind is waiting for gravity to take over, and for the candies to come tumbling down.  The focus could be a little sharper at the top of the photo.  I''m not sure I love the border, although I see the point in adding it, since there is so much white in the composition.over all a very creative and nicely done entry.', '2006-05-12 01:49:22.000000', NULL, 0),
