(2411615, 327881, 57229, '<td valign="top">You asked for comments on low scores (4 from me). The competency of the picture is fine - it''s in focus, well put together, I don''t have to squint at it and so on. I guess I''m more than a little hung up on the principle of pictures being visual things and depending on a visual language. Taking a picture of a word (or acronym) spoils that. So there is self fulfilling prophecy in your alphabeti spaghetti there...</td>', 'You asked for comments on low scores (4 from me). The competency of the picture is fine - it''s in focus, well put together, I don''t have to squint at it and so on. I guess I''m more than a little hung up on the principle of pictures being visual things and depending on a visual language. Taking a picture of a word (or acronym) spoils that. So there is self fulfilling prophecy in your alphabeti spaghetti there...', '2006-05-13 04:57:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2411745, 329124, 31133, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much for all the comments! This is a personal best, which is funny since I made the picture half jokingly, after reading a bunch of posts about there being too many flowers :-) That''s why in my mind, the saying fit the image.</td>', 'Thank you very much for all the comments! This is a personal best, which is funny since I made the picture half jokingly, after reading a bunch of posts about there being too many flowers :-) That''s why in my mind, the saying fit the image.', '2006-05-13 08:01:20.000000', NULL, 0),
