(2424478, 329154, 57229, '<td valign="top">Oops - confession time. I misread the title and took it to mean no borders as in ''stand by to repel boarders''. My bad, sorry. Maybe <i>sans frontières</i> might have helped?<br/> <br/>Edited for - er - would you believe, spelling?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-17 08:54:42.</i></td>', 'Oops - confession time. I misread the title and took it to mean no borders as in ''stand by to repel boarders''. My bad, sorry. Maybe sans frontières might have helped? Edited for - er - would you believe, spelling?', '2006-05-17 09:53:18.000000', '2006-05-17 09:54:42.000000', 0),
