(2427624, 329309, 38496, '<td valign="top">From CTP2:<br/> <br/>To be honest, I didn''t entirely ''get'' this at first.  It''s hard to tell what the sliver thing surrounding the nine is, so it''s not obvious that it is ''stitching''.  Good play on words once I figured it out.<br/>I like the composition of the clock, and the contrast of the red thread with the black and white clock, and the ligthing is dramatic.<br/></td>', 'From CTP2: To be honest, I didn''t entirely ''get'' this at first.  It''s hard to tell what the sliver thing surrounding the nine is, so it''s not obvious that it is ''stitching''.  Good play on words once I figured it out.I like the composition of the clock, and the contrast of the red thread with the black and white clock, and the ligthing is dramatic.', '2006-05-17 22:31:31.000000', NULL, 0),
