(2480964, 328940, 55773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by szalona:</b></div><hr/><i> dont see how the photo really fits the title, nor how the title makes it a cliche or saying. nor how the photo does so. </i></td></tr></table> ;This is deffinently a cliche, on the basis of your comment. The photo is awsome, the rustic feel of the girl in all her glory (make-up) is a reflection of what the title suggests. This is clearly a well thought out title and subject, while the blotches and the border add to the drama that prevokes. Well done, to bad it was disqualified.</td>', 'Originally posted by szalona: dont see how the photo really fits the title, nor how the title makes it a cliche or saying. nor how the photo does so.  ;This is deffinently a cliche, on the basis of your comment. The photo is awsome, the rustic feel of the girl in all her glory (make-up) is a reflection of what the title suggests. This is clearly a well thought out title and subject, while the blotches and the border add to the drama that prevokes. Well done, to bad it was disqualified.', '2006-06-03 09:44:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2480965, 328940, 55773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by szalona:</b></div><hr/><i> dont see how the photo really fits the title, nor how the title makes it a cliche or saying. nor how the photo does so. </i></td></tr></table> ;This is deffinently a cliche, on the basis of your comment. The photo is awsome, the rustic feel of the girl in all her glory (make-up) is a reflection of what the title suggests. This is clearly a well thought out title and subject, while the blotches and the border add to the drama that prevokes. Well done, to bad it was disqualified.</td>', 'Originally posted by szalona: dont see how the photo really fits the title, nor how the title makes it a cliche or saying. nor how the photo does so.  ;This is deffinently a cliche, on the basis of your comment. The photo is awsome, the rustic feel of the girl in all her glory (make-up) is a reflection of what the title suggests. This is clearly a well thought out title and subject, while the blotches and the border add to the drama that prevokes. Well done, to bad it was disqualified.', '2006-06-03 09:44:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2488350, 329244, 3214, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, and interesting light!</td>', 'Lovely portrait, and interesting light!', '2006-06-06 00:25:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2489083, 328737, 21816, '<td valign="top">I used to work with a belly dancer and yes, they do love their curves. I agree about the white balance though, it does appear to be incorrect and needs to be warmer. The other thing that hits me here is the sharpness of her face. It looks a bit soft because of the shutter speed but you''ve captured the sense of movement in her lower half which is good. It''s hard to balance the two out. Don''t be too discouraged by the score. Go out and take some more shots! :)</td>', 'I used to work with a belly dancer and yes, they do love their curves. I agree about the white balance though, it does appear to be incorrect and needs to be warmer. The other thing that hits me here is the sharpness of her face. It looks a bit soft because of the shutter speed but you''ve captured the sense of movement in her lower half which is good. It''s hard to balance the two out. Don''t be too discouraged by the score. Go out and take some more shots! :)', '2006-06-06 05:23:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2495074, 329326, 37779, '<td valign="top">Deserved a much higher score! This is most excellent! I love the DOF, it''s perfect!</td>', 'Deserved a much higher score! This is most excellent! I love the DOF, it''s perfect!', '2006-06-07 15:01:58.000000', NULL, 0),
