(2713829, 327504, 23394, '<td valign="top"><i>revisiting my faves...</i> <br/> <br/>you know what''s wrong with this shot?  that i didn''t take it.  this image is the final rendering of itself.  NOBODY will ever duplicate this shot better.  trying to would by like trying to remake Casablanca--why bother?  this is a stunning example of getting it right the first time.  i can hardly imagine a better sky, better lighting, better anything.  really, what could be different that could improve on this?  not a thing.  i just wish it had been me that could take credit.</td>', 'revisiting my faves...  you know what''s wrong with this shot?  that i didn''t take it.  this image is the final rendering of itself.  NOBODY will ever duplicate this shot better.  trying to would by like trying to remake Casablanca--why bother?  this is a stunning example of getting it right the first time.  i can hardly imagine a better sky, better lighting, better anything.  really, what could be different that could improve on this?  not a thing.  i just wish it had been me that could take credit.', '2006-08-10 07:09:41.000000', NULL, 0),
